Package: xpipe
Title: A Personal Medallion Data Pipeline for Health Administrative Data
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Andrea", "Fidecicchi", , "andreafidecicchi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for ingesting, validating, and promoting
    health administrative data through a medallion architecture (Batch,
    Bronze, Silver layers). Implements configurable ingestion methods,
    privacy rules, and append-only promotion with full lineage tracking.
